/-!
# A181657

Generalized (conditional) Riordan array with k-th column generated by x^k * (1 + x - x^2 + x^3)/(1 - 2x^2 - x^4) if k mod 2 = 0, x^k * (1+x)/(1 - 2x^2 - x^4) otherwise.

The 66 terms known to OEIS, indexed from `0`.

Skeleton generated by `lake exe oeis-gen`; every declaration is a `sorry` placeholder.
-/

namespace A181657

